# Aether Browser — .gitignore
# Chromium-based browser project. See docs/development/SETUP_WINDOWS.md for build setup.

# SECTION 1 — Chromium and Brave Build Output
# Chromium build output can exceed 100GB. Never commit these under any circumstances.
out/
out.gn/
*.ninja_deps
*.ninja_log
.gclient
.gclient_entries
*.stamp
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# SECTION 2 — Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnp.*
.yarn/cache/
.yarn/unplugged/

# SECTION 3 — Rust Build Artifacts
# Note: Cargo.lock for binary crates (ai-service, sync-service) SHOULD be committed.
# Only ignore Cargo.lock for library crates if they exist.
target/

# SECTION 4 — Frontend Build Output
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# SECTION 5 — Environment and Secrets
# Never commit secrets, API keys, or local environment overrides.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# SECTION 6 — IDE Files
# .vscode/ is intentionally tracked and should NOT appear here.
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
.vs/
*.sln.docstates

# SECTION 7 — Operating System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk

# SECTION 8 — Test and Coverage
coverage/
*.lcov
test-results/
.vitest/
playwright-report/

# SECTION 9 — Logs and Crash Reports
*.log
logs/
crash_reports/

# SECTION 10 — Temporary Files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# SECTION 11 — Research and External Repositories
# Cloned external repositories for reference only. Never commit these.
# See SOURCE_CLASSIFICATION.md for details.
.aether/research/
